itioned absolutely within each week row, computed from `weeks[]`)\n- Cross-week vertical connectors\n- Animation tuning in React Native Reanimated\n- Applying the same toggle to the GitHub-style year heatmap\n\n## Verification\n\n1. Open `.superdesign/design_iterations/month_chain_toggle_1.html` in a browser\n2. Both panels render side-by-side at desktop width; stack at mobile\n3. Click the toggle on the right panel — connectors animate in/out smoothly\n4. Visually confirm: chains only span same-week completions, missed days break the chain, today's ring still visible\n5. User reviews and either approves the direction or requests visual changes before any production code is written\n",
